ungen sind hochgradig anpassbar und k\u00f6nnen f\u00fcr eigene Projekte genutzt werden.", "short_description": "Artivact ist ein kostenloses, quelloffenes Werkzeug zur Sammlungsverwaltung und -pr\u00e4sentation.\nMit Artivact XR kannst du diese Sammlungen in der virtuellen Realit\u00e4t erleben."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "quest_portrait.png", "id": "4209759382644599", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393841_4209759385977932_3266183942185304833_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TSPIb2-VUcUQ7kNvwGlfRWE&_nc_oc=Adpp6o16eTabWz3rWeEjWvoSDDe94pkejvETAucFHY5dQ4j79SRggtmbCQReXgCpyxA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTpI-PimoIcBko6_v_F_QRQ8DDjgcl5Lrg_E82I1ebnEg&oe=6AEB4D7C"}, {"file_name": "quest_hero_cover.png", "id": "1263316755151138", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499292244_1263316758484471_159357681156275043_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=087UnTv5emUQ7kNvwGJJGSH&_nc_oc=AdplrS6uXkl1NR0qTeZYXnO1VLm7FrZ4xJ9iollXLgYVI-fDcEayXDwNlqX9b0suoA8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSRANSEWoWq2x0VybPT7pb0hSfGDji4yv-kprFX0fVTTQ&oe=6AEB3196"}, {"file_name": "quest_landscape.png", "id": "1039024501005104", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393450_1039024504338437_7487200977707356540_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=b1AoqdORFVwQ7kNvwGUnnKB&_nc_oc=AdoO4S5jy8C3u0idygr3Eggyrw9-iQt7WYVdUZ03mjlteos_-_UklNvIha4x75lsaeI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR9RjSo2pcd05EueBeLXmxmsiniVJKrwG6zYr6jL622mg&oe=6AEB3F64"}, {"file_name": "quest_logo.png", "id": "707346191636121", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499302233_707346198302787_7894586970020286030_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_